    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Claude Code estimated cost",
      "description": "Claude Code respects the Machine and Billing filters; LiteLLM is always everything. Claude Code's own estimate: tokens x API list prices. On billing=pro it's what the usage would have cost on the API, not money spent. On billing=api it tracks real spend. Converted from USD at a fixed 0.744 (2026 average), so it's a guesstimate in pounds.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
